{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_014_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:19fa9482794bcad9f9e9b58a94e0f579e3a4587671bd2e6cec274cc435125060",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1749b2e403ed486913e24bcd3490de927c37efc3a5846c0788bb31b203465499",
      "text": "谢谢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000022:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:56ab9e92246cf711dade426b2c00a75cf1c362f3d5d8ffa133dda088233fc77b",
      "text": "……哇，看起来超级好吃啊……！\n这到底叠了多少层啊？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fe9b17e1edda40a6f30e10682ad38927a806a5ed6db9cf10ec038d3fb14a44b1",
      "text": "英雄先生，您先请吧。\n请趁热吃。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1ccc494c395cd7ff38db2cc04aed429cb973c949202f3b340c0a20053741e20b",
      "text": "……那、不好意思啦。\n我就先开动了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5d2d52618b7413815b2167ed1883e6d30c0333d5c94b5d393882d42ec30a565f",
      "text": "我开动了！嗯～……太好吃了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:590af2ec5b4c7f0aec1c4c595966758eabf09b4bcb2e6b715e37fe42bfe68737",
      "text": "英雄先生吃得看起来真香啊！\n充分传达出您有多喜欢松饼了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b06772fcc86d4828460a60fdf3101fd383cdc0ae64149c986f1274448310b110",
      "text": "是、是吗？总觉得有点不好意思啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:51dcf4f501717270d7190bd94fe1fb3543eda3591744540f63b781c8ca6f56cd",
      "text": "啊，●●●●プロデューサー，\n能把那边的枫糖浆递给我吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7952aa8ffa11fc789b3e00bea53e969eeedbecd2086456580ff9fff9cce0c488",
      "text": "好的，给您。\n您也很喜欢枫糖浆吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:48b4c1d32d7bd6cd8c2afa2a40d00217876eea26199c0fe6c37383052e8e35cb",
      "text": "是啊。我就喜欢这种吃法。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:668cde065a638b6d615371e37608e07589215bb69f327eef580cb6efb706cf83",
      "text": "在松饼上淋上满满的枫糖浆\n再吃下去。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_014hid_01_1_2_014_01:1_2_014_01_d:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8093c0fb5b6bb6e82aafabe532c11d8004ab2b9df3f6fe84a85aee303f2a261",
      "text": "这松饼本身就很好吃，制作人吃了之后，\n肯定也会露出跟我一样的表情的！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
